    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into a hand-drawn and animated world where your mission is simple: <strong>find all the cats!</strong> Explore lively environments, trigger surprising interactions, and keep your eyes peeled to spot every detail. Observation is key to uncover these mischievous felines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3324060/extras/5875e5a1e433bb1160b73f3c4d1c9dbd.poster.avif?t=1752614019\" width=800 height=531 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3324060/extras/5875e5a1e433bb1160b73f3c4d1c9dbd.webm?t=1752614019\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Flip through the pages of a notebook and explore around 30 different levels over the course of approximately 2 hours, gradually filling your wagons with all the cats you discover.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But be careful \u2014 time is ticking. Once a level starts, you only have a short while before the storm catches up. Thankfully, some characters are there to help, and a hint system is available if you get stuck.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And if you manage to find them all, a final challenge awaits: a hidden mystery object has been placed in each level \u2014 can you spot them all?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Special thanks to the creators of <i>Oddada</i>, a game that made it possible for me to compose the entire soundtrack.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into a hand-drawn and animated world where your mission is simple: <strong>find all the cats!</strong> Explore lively environments, trigger surprising interactions, and keep your eyes peeled to spot every detail. Observation is key to uncover these mischievous felines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3324060/extras/5875e5a1e433bb1160b73f3c4d1c9dbd.poster.avif?t=1752614019\" width=800 height=531 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3324060/extras/5875e5a1e433bb1160b73f3c4d1c9dbd.webm?t=1752614019\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Flip through the pages of a notebook and explore around 30 different levels over the course of approximately 2 hours, gradually filling your wagons with all the cats you discover.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But be careful \u2014 time is ticking. Once a level starts, you only have a short while before the storm catches up. Thankfully, some characters are there to help, and a hint system is available if you get stuck.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And if you manage to find them all, a final challenge awaits: a hidden mystery object has been placed in each level \u2014 can you spot them all?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Special thanks to the creators of <i>Oddada</i>, a game that made it possible for me to compose the entire soundtrack.</p>",
    "short_description": "Find the hidden cats! In animated, hand-drawn environments, trigger fun interactions and pay attention to the tiniest details to uncover them. Can you find them all?",
